==English==

===Etymology===
From {{compound|en|belly|ache}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈbɛliˌeɪk/}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-bellyache.ogg|a=US}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Any [[pain]] in the [[belly]], [[stomach]], or [[abdomen]].
#: {{ux|en|Eating too much candy can give you a '''bellyache'''.}}

====Synonyms====
